                <pb facs="1338" n="1328" sameAs="frus:frus1944v04/pg1328"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">701.6266A/8–2344: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-08-23T21:00:00+02:00">August 23, 1944—9
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 9:40 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>6848. ReDeptel 6219, August 5, midnight.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d1238-f1"/> On
                    August 19 Foreign Office despatched note to Swiss Legation concerning
                    repatriation of officials of the German Embassy to the Holy See. Text of note
                    which follows lines set forth in Embassy’s 6181, August 3, 4 p.m., is being
                    transmitted in Embassy’s airgram A–1029, August 23.<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d1238-f2"/> Foreign Office decided not to allow the Vatican
                    representative to accompany the party after consulting with British Minister to
                    Holy See. Foreign Office omitted Elling from the list of Germans since the
                    Allied Forces Headquarters has special grounds why in its opinion Elling should
                    not be accorded diplomatic status. (ReDeptel 6513, August 17, 2 a.m.<anchor
                        n="1" xml:id="d1238-f3"/>)</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Winant</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
